Why MIT and not GPL-3.0: Hearthlight is a community launcher that pack makers,
server owners and contributors should be able to embed, fork and redistribute
with the fewest legal surprises (including inside proprietary modpack tooling).
MIT keeps the code open without imposing copyleft on everyone who ships it.
